{"organizations": [], "uuid": "ff15f080ad9cee29453ddb85eab849606f21907f", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 0, "shares": 0, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "cn.reuters.com", "main_image": "https://s4.reutersmedia.net/resources_v2/images/rcom-default.png", "site_section": "http://cn.reuters.com/rssFeed/CNIntlBizNews/", "section_title": "路透: 国际财经", "url": "https://cn.reuters.com/article/fujitsu-sale-mobile-0126-friday-updates-idCNKBS1FF0AO", "country": "US", "domain_rank": 408, "title": "富士通在洽商向投资基金出售旗下移动电话业务（更新版）", "performance_score": 0, "site": "reuters.com", "participants_count": 0, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.0, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-01-26T04:53:00.000+02:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "ff15f080ad9cee29453ddb85eab849606f21907f"}, "author": "", "url": "https://cn.reuters.com/article/fujitsu-sale-mobile-0126-friday-updates-idCNKBS1FF0AO", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "富士通在洽商向投资基金出售旗下移动电话业务（更新版）", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [], "locations": [], "organizations": []}, "highlightText": "", "language": "chinese", "persons": [], "text": "January 26, 2018 / 2:55 AM / 更新于 5 hours ago 富士通在洽商向投资基金出售旗下移动电话业务（更新版） \n路透1月26日 - 富士通( 6702.T )周五表示，正就出售旗下移动电话业务给投资基金Polaris Capital展开磋商。当地媒体报导称，该交易价值可能高达500亿日圆(4.56亿美元)左右。 \n日经报导称，月底前预计将有正式协议，并称富士通将出售在该业务的多数持股。 \n富士通及其他日本手机制造商在全球智能手机竞赛中表现不佳，很快就被苹果( AAPL.O )、三星电子( 005930.KS )及中国同行甩在后面。 \n富士通也一直在剥离其他非核心业务。去年，联想集团( 0992.HK )同意收购富士通个人电脑业务的多数股权，交易价值高至2.69亿美元。 \n根据日经报导，保留手机部门的员工和工厂将可能是交易的条件之一。另外，富士通料在Polaris管理之下继续运营Arrows品牌。(完) 编译 李爽/王兴亚；审校 李婷仪/张若琪", "external_links": [], "published": "2018-01-26T04:53:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-01-26T05:08:54.001+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}